/ ATLAS-8 LABORATORY DEVICE 54: EDUCATIONAL EXTENSIONS
/ NOT ORIGINAL DEC PDP-8/I DEVICE ASSIGNMENTS.
LABCLR=6540
LABGO=6541
LABRDY=6542
LABTIM=6543
LABGET=6544
LABSTS=6545
LABHI=6546
*0200
        CLA             / AC LOW THREE BITS SELECT ADC CHANNEL A0
        LABGO           / REQUEST ADC SAMPLE FROM MSP430
WAIT,   LABRDY          / SKIP WHEN DEVICE HAS A VALUE
        JMP WAIT       / SPIN WITHOUT BLOCKING DEVICE
        CLA
        LABGET          / OR 10-BIT RESULT INTO AC
        DCA RESULT     / WRITE RESULT TO PDP-8 MEMORY
        HLT
RESULT, 0
$
